        "created_at": "2012-05-15T19:03:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I would agree that when it says “until” it does not include the start of your next turn, making it more or less equivalent to “up through the end of the turn before your next turn,” so Galvanize and Evolution do not apply during the start of your next turn at all.</p>",
